  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "#### Added\n- Multi-targets `net10.0` and `net11.0`.\n\n#### Changed\n- `ProcessResult` / `BufferedProcessResult` equality now compares `ExecutedFilePath` with the platform path comparison (`OrdinalIgnoreCase` on Windows, `Ordinal` elsewhere), so results differing only by path casing compare equal on Windows.\n- `ProcessConfiguration.Equals` computes faster and order-independent environment-variable comparisons; string comparisons in the equality paths are explicitly ordinal.\n\n#### Fixed\n- `ProcessExitConfigurationCreationExtensions.Default` now matches the constructor default (allows unexpected-exit exceptions) instead of aliasing `CreateGraceful()`.\n- Null environment-variable values are honored as BCL variable removal instead of being silently dropped; empty-string values remain a valid way to clear a variable.\n\n#### Removed\n- The `Polyfill` dependency - Core now has **zero runtime package dependencies**.",
